Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it be so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a good verse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You really made me mad, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you get!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Intimidation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Megabug!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it was big enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to be impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're surprised, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Tiger. Blowfish. Fish Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of curious why you're\Ntalking like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll deflate if I keep\Nmy mouth open, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kraken is still way bigger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't crush me, damn it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is zooming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're squashing all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Still a shrimp compared to the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have been able to protect\Nyou, and we failed, we pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,worthless vassals!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.18,0:04:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, did\Nyou see the Noah? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tragic that it's been moved\Nunder such circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Deccan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought you would sink so\Nlow as to destroy your own island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just as shocked as you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We even tried to order an\Nisland-wide evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But those new fishman pirate bastards\Nare blocking any transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even worse, we haven't been able to make\Ncontact with the border guards out at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to shoot the bubble now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get the king out\Nof here in some place safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting right here for the princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What in blazes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone explain this. What's\Nhappening, like for starters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,where did all these Damn\Npirates come from will sir
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are on our side
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe and the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart Deccan So that's what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright men Everything is clear to me now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you to the plaza. Follow\NJinbe. Back up the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Straw Hats can\Nhandle the more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighters, our men can suppress\Nthe others. It's insane. We
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,tried to arrest them yet\Nthey're fighting To save
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,our island We should be\Nashamed for not trusting them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to make things right\Nand give them our support.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! It's Neptune's army. Hey, no\Nbig deal—we can crush them. Kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,them all Stand tall and show these\Nbastards what they're made of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Humble, humble, humble. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,March, slave tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn right and head that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Worthless klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drag the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that pathetic flesh bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's truly disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you perhaps use your\Npower to free those slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:06:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't care for fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock them unconscious if they\Ntry to take their grudge out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the life that they're living\Nright now, they're even lower than beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This behavior was learned\Nfrom the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All our callers! They came off! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal here? The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's taking the callers\Noff of the slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong\Nwith you worthless slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.56,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free. Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why save us when we were\Nfighting against you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say no to a handsome man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, thank Boss Jinbe. Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you! They're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Troll net!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put you in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax, this won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, how are there two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Double...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, got Hammond!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a whole lot for the help, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards treated us like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pay you back for every\Nbeating you gave me and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy just freed all our slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a revolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the border guard\Npatrol calling, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I reached the minister of the left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you need to\Nwarn the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Noah, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just been informed it's lost power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, it's begun falling again,\Nand it's hurling towards the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What could this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you calling from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The air tank, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From the control tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you can warn everyone\Nabout the impending danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All our communication centers are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You can contact the state-operated\Ntransponder snails all across the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency announcement to\Nall citizens of the Ryugu Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,An evacuation has been issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant ship known as the NOAA\Nis falling towards Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone must flee the area immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble's gonna break!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The island will be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget about your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to leave the island to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's falling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tim, you better fix\Nthis mess quick, Loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened\Nto Princess Shura Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Tekken trying to pull,\Nthat crazy son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no choice but to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship will kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave Heart and\Nhis associates to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you citizens are\Nordered to flee the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Women and children especially!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:10:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats may be a\Nbunch of human pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're all down there\Nfighting to save our island!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just run away and let them\Ndie when they're trying to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We asked them to help us and I'm\Nnot going to turn my back on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight with them, but I won't\Nleave them here to die and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm assigning you a duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell every other spectator they\Nneed to evacuate right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to stay, then\Nsave the others while you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nargue with you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want to stay\Nbehind, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, outlaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to face my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Straw Hat Luffy all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Air Tank we've\Nmet once before. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're broadcasting to the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've heard everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We are prepared to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can see the Noah hurtling\Ntoward the island as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy, I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear those fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're broadcasting their\Nconversation across the entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After we deploy the bubble,\Nthe rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make it more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go for it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And more than that, what's\Nthe princess doing with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Straw Hat guy's the\None who kidnapped her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And Luffy, everyone\Nhere is counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone else confused\Nwhy the Border Guard's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,asking a human pirate to save the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, does this mean that\Nthe human is on board the Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So is he trying to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat. What prince spook?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,of ocean he spoke earlier and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear now. Heart is keep talking.\NJust tell us what Heart is already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a fish man. He's a monster\Nbrought to life by our hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The new Fishman Pirates, they're nothing\Nbut remnants of a grudge from ages past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We allowed their evil to fester\Nin the shadow of Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and they began to champion\Nthis meaningless grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying its flag in some misguided sense\Nof pride, they fear a future without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, they want humans to be evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, there is no reason\Nto justify their crusade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All they desire is bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And despite what they say, they\Ndon't want peace for fish man either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What did humans do to you\Nthat was so unforgivable?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What in this world could\Ninspire such cruelty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that's your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The simple truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We were chosen by heaven\Nto punish the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have the power to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand now this\Nsick and pathetic truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All of their fury, their hatred, it doesn't\Ncome from experience or logic or fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They have no substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just empty cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Their hatred, it doesn't come\Nfrom experience or logic or fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They have no substance, just\Nempty cruelty. So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I get what he's saying, but how\Nare they going to stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you standing around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get off the island right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the shadow of the Nua already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right over our heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Whip Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks even more\Nfrightening than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Never forget that, Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Barely fit to serve us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it we're done for ever since the\Ngreat pirate era started we've been losing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,more and more of our people every day the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,humans take the mermaids\Nto sabo odi and sell
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,them off some of them went missing this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,morning i'm telling you\Nit's just a matter of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Time before Fishman Island falls. Filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,humans we gotta kill\Nthem before they kill us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up. This man\Nsacrificed his life to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,up the human shop and\Nset the Slave's free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch, sir's right, stupid humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that guy's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I wanna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong sank another human pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll tell you about those\Nwretched worms called humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ages ago, when they realized that we,\Nthe fishmen, were the superior race,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,they became jealous and afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, they began to\Npersecute our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The human race plagued the entire\Nworld like the vermin they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They used their numbers to\Ngain dominance over our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all of us fishmen were\Ndriven down here to the sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, and don't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this really nice human name\NRayleigh I made friends with on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not mean like the rest are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even look that\Ndisgusted when he sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Heart, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like your stupid stories, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans fear the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You must keep the bitterness\Nof the dead alive, Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The very existence of\Nhumanity is pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger's been slain by humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The hero of the fishmen is dead! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Tiger was not the hero we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true you gave your blood to humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was dying, I had to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole country's mad,\Nright down to the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:19:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen's looking to\Nmake nice with the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard he joined the\Nseven warlords recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The hour long pirates are the only\Nones with any pride these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Blatant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Orohime has been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the humans are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They would even stoop so\Nlow as to kill the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and after she's been so kind to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If the royal family is too meek\Nto hold the humans accountable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then I can't be loyal\Nto this kingdom anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be ruled\Nby a bunch of cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The heavens have repaid that\Nspineless otohime for bowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to forgive humans\Ndeserves a big dose into the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been chosen by the heavens,\Ngranted this unstoppable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are legendary here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get your hands on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can duplicate these, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of the Fishman\NDistrict must come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A proud crusade is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kill as many humans as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the day we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been chosen by heaven\Nto bring about the revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The day of reckoning is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the\Nroad for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:22:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been biding our\Ntime for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll take our revenge at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have stopped all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now the royal family turned their\Neyes away from the fishman district.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.94,0:22:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In our negligence we allowed it to become\Na breeding ground for violence and hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We pretended not to see the resentment that\Nbuilt up as a result of their isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as it descended into lawlessness,\Nwe lived in willful ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought collecting those\Nsignatures would help,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't addressing the true issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.04,0:22:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:23:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't pollute the children's\Nminds with your anger towards humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not make it theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all her pleading, the things she\Nfeared had already been set in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The real enemy was the resentment\Nbrewing inside our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt it too, that hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But refusing to admit that, I looked\Noutward when I should have looked inward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother's true killer was\Nthe grudge that pestered
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,among our people while\Nwe turned a blind eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I believe she knew\Nit in that very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear children, it\Ndoesn't matter who hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't become angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, not on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't submit to resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let hatred get the better\Nof you, and my name or any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:24:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I listened to my mother's words, but part\Nof me wasn't able to let go of my anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but hate\Nhumans for killing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A person's pain dies with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A grudge is created by the living, and\Nonly the living make it grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of my prejudice, I overlooked what\Nwas happening in the Fishman district.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.14,0:24:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the time I came to my senses, it\Nwas already spiraling out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.68,0:24:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.96,0:24:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the people of Fishman Island will\Nbe done in by their own hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.90,0:24:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A foe more deadly than any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.98,0:24:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be tough, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like the island's bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It might shoot right past the Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.54,0:24:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs to get close\Nenough to surround it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.66,0:24:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No more, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhead, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Erase our past!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.46,0:25:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Set us back to zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.22,0:25:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eradicate the shadows cast by our\Ngrudge so that we may see the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.48,0:25:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, get ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.04,0:25:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.22,0:25:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We must!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you give it a rest already?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The rage of our people will never die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.74,0:25:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Hachi, just let me\Ndo this my way. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:25:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.02,0:26:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys fighting Horty's\Ncrew in the plaza, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.52,0:26:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And Boss Jinbe too. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.04,0:26:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Foofy's place. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.32,0:26:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.36,0:26:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds were made up as\Nsoon as we got to the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With Jinbei's help, we were\Ngonna save this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.52,0:26:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me and my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.62,0:26:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what friends are for, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We should never have\Nsuspected him, human or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.70,0:27:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.54,0:27:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.34,0:27:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna stay here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.66,0:27:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.24,0:27:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.30,0:27:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.05,0:27:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's air on the Noah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.40,0:27:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to catch you\Nalong before you get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Luffy? You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.28,0:28:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead, and I promise\NI won't let Heart hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.62,0:28:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling brave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That machine's no match for\Nthe spirit of the squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.60,0:28:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just spit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.06,0:28:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I can copy\Nmyself with squitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.14,0:28:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit of the squid is under...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.18,0:28:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.09,0:28:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be dried squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.00,0:28:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.91,0:29:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know your robot\Ncould shoot fireballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.64,0:29:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How many cool attacks can this baby do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.28,0:29:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That came out of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.11,0:29:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't have let\Nyour guard down, little guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.98,0:29:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Paul!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.89,0:29:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Be shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.10,0:29:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.76,0:29:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who uses their bare hand to stop a hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I probably could have\Nfound a less painful way to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.80,0:29:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, I thought that one was\Nsupposed to be your normal-looking form.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you're okay looking so freaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.42,0:29:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.74,0:29:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to look human before,\Nbecause I didn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.88,0:29:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I want to be a monster\Nso I can help Luffy. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.18,0:29:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slice that smile right off your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.50,0:30:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the real strongest\Nswordsman on Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.88,0:30:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but your time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.86,0:30:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a word that I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.44,0:30:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.12,0:30:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,From you and anything you've got!
